:"Liver (CYP3A4)"},{"what":"leaves","says":"Kidney"}],"figures":"Scopolamine"},"uses":{"text":"Scopolamine, also known as hyoscine, or Devil's Breath, is a muscarinic antagonist and tropane alkaloid used to treat motion sickness and postoperative nausea and vomiting. It is also sometimes used before surgery to decrease saliva. When used by injection, effects begin after about 20 minutes and last for up to 8 hours.","source":"Wikipedia","page":"Scopolamine","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Scopolamine","brands":"Transderm Scop","routes":"By mouth, transdermal, ophthalmic, subcutaneous, intravenous, sublingual, rectal, buccal, transmucosal, intramuscular","figures":"Scopolamine"},"zh":"東莨菪鹼","zhHans":"东莨菪碱","zhOther":"東良若鹼, 東茛若鹼, 東茛菪鹼, 左旋-天仙子胺","zhHansOther":"东良若碱, 东茛若碱, 东茛菪碱, 左旋-天仙子胺","summaryZh":"東莨菪鹼（USAN（美國採用名稱）:scopolamine），INN:hyoscine）或稱惡魔之息），是一種用於治療暈動病以及術後噁心嘔吐的藥物。它有時也於個體在手術之前使用，以減少其唾液分泌。","summaryZhHans":"东莨菪碱（USAN（美国采用名称）:scopolamine），INN:hyoscine）或称恶魔之息），是一种用于治疗晕动病以及术后恶心呕吐的药物。它有时也于个体在手术之前使用，以减少其唾液分泌。"}